const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"首先问估计结果有多不确定",en:"Start with uncertainty around estimates"},body:{zh:"论文讨论矩条件估计中的渐近协方差：参数估计不仅需要一个数值，还需要描述其不确定性，才能构造置信区间或检验。矩条件本身要求相应期望为零。如果这一识别前提错误，改用稳健协方差并不会自动使估计拥有正确的经济含义。",en:"The paper studies asymptotic covariance in moment-based estimation. A parameter estimate needs an uncertainty measure for confidence intervals and tests. The underlying moments must have zero expectation; changing the covariance estimator cannot automatically repair an invalid identifying condition."},reference:{url:"https://www.nber.org/system/files/working_papers/t0055/t0055.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：1986年2月修订工作论文，第1页",en:"Source: February 1986 revised working paper, pp. 1"}}},{title:{zh:"序列相关使不同时间共同影响方差",en:"Dependence links observations across time"},body:{zh:"长期协方差不仅包含同一期矩向量的波动，还包含不同滞后之间的协方差。忽略这些项会遗漏时间依赖结构；异方差又意味着波动规模并不固定。这里处理的是用于推断的协方差对象，不能把它误读成预测未来价格波动的直接模型。",en:"Long-run covariance includes both contemporaneous variation in the moment vector and lagged covariances. Omitting lag terms discards temporal dependence, while heteroskedasticity allows changing variation. This is a covariance object for inference, not by itself a model that forecasts future price volatility."},reference:{url:"https://www.nber.org/system/files/working_papers/t0055/t0055.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：1986年2月修订工作论文，第1–2页",en:"Source: February 1986 revised working paper, pp. 1–2"}}},{title:{zh:"直接截断求和可能产生负方差问题",en:"Unweighted truncation can misbehave"},body:{zh:"一种直观做法是把有限个滞后的样本协方差直接相加，但所得矩阵在有限样本中未必半正定。这样可能出现负的估计方差或难以解释的检验统计量。作者要解决的不只是能否算出结果，还包括协方差估计是否具有必要的数学性质。",en:"Simply summing sample covariances over finitely many lags need not produce a positive semidefinite matrix in a finite sample. Negative estimated variances or problematic test statistics may follow. The construction therefore addresses a mathematical property of covariance estimation, not just computational convenience."},reference:{url:"https://www.nber.org/system/files/working_papers/t0055/t0055.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：1986年2月修订工作论文，第2–3页",en:"Source: February 1986 revised working paper, pp. 2–3"}}},{title:{zh:"离得更远的滞后获得更小权重",en:"More distant lags receive smaller weights"},body:{zh:"论文使用随滞后递减的权重：若截断参数为m，第j阶的权重是1−j/(m+1)，并把滞后协方差与其转置一起加入。同一期项另行保留。实现时需要同时核对索引、转置与权重，不能只保留“使用若干滞后”这个笼统描述。",en:"With truncation parameter m, lag j receives weight 1−j/(m+1); its covariance and transpose enter together alongside the contemporaneous term. Implementation requires consistent lag indexing, transposes and weights, not merely an instruction to include a few lagged observations."},reference:{url:"https://www.nber.org/system/files/working_papers/t0055/t0055.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：1986年2月修订工作论文，第3–4页",en:"Source: February 1986 revised working paper, pp. 3–4"}}},{title:{zh:"半正定不等于一定能求逆",en:"Positive semidefinite does not mean invertible"},body:{zh:"该加权构造保证的半正定性质允许零特征值，并不等于矩阵必然严格正定或可逆。存在冗余矩条件、秩不足或数值问题时，后续计算仍需检查。不要把这项性质理解为每个检验都一定有效，或任何样本下都能直接完成矩阵求逆。",en:"The positive semidefinite property permits zero eigenvalues and does not guarantee invertibility. Redundant moments, rank deficiency or numerical problems still need scrutiny. This property is not a promise that every test is valid or that matrix inversion succeeds for every sample."},reference:{url:"https://www.nber.org/system/files/working_papers/t0055/t0055.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：1986年2月修订工作论文，第3–4页",en:"Source: February 1986 revised working paper, pp. 3–4"}}},{title:{zh:"滞后设置和样本仍影响推断",en:"Lag choices and sample size still matter"},body:{zh:"一致性是随样本增长、在相应假设下成立的结论，不能直接等同于短样本的准确置信区间。截断参数决定保留多少依赖信息，也会影响估计噪声。阅读经验研究时，应记录滞后规则与样本频率，而不是只看到“Newey–West”名称就停止核对。",en:"Consistency is an asymptotic statement under assumptions, not a guarantee of accurate confidence intervals in short samples. Truncation governs retained dependence information and estimation noise. An empirical study should state its lag rule and observation frequency rather than relying on the Newey–West label alone."},reference:{url:"https://www.nber.org/system/files/working_papers/t0055/t0055.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：1986年2月修订工作论文，第1–4页",en:"Source: February 1986 revised working paper, pp. 1–4"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"导读依据1986年修订工作论文，题录保留1987年期刊版。稳健协方差依赖矩条件与渐近假设，不能修复内生性，也不保证小样本推断准确。",en:"This guide uses the revised 1986 working paper and retains the 1987 journal citation. Robust covariance relies on moment conditions and asymptotic assumptions; it does not repair endogeneity or guarantee accurate small-sample inference."}};export{e as default};
